    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat percentage of Mr. Roper's class are football players? Mr. Roper's class has 32 students.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Roper's class has 30 students.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: 25% of Mr. Roper's class are football players.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. 20% of Mr. Roper's class are football players.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: the school records football players as a separate group from cheerleaders and band members.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: Football players, cheerleaders, and band members need to leave early to travel to an away game.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
